  "feature_objective": "M2-5: implement the ACT-2 central bounded repair router, lineage-owned per-class budgets, trusted retry evidence and fail-closed escalation.",
  "acceptance_criteria": [
    "ACT-2 routes only RETRY, REPAIR or ESCALATE and has no closure route.",
    "Repair authority requires exact trusted REVIEW_REPAIRABLE evidence for the candidate and packet.",
    "Per-class and aggregate lineage budgets cannot be replenished by creating another controller or changing repair agent.",
    "Retry requires trusted transient evidence for the same candidate, consumes no repair budget, and repeated identical retry strategy is rejected.",
    "Repair authorization consumes budget before mutation, is scope-bound, and records root cause, evidence, strategy and remaining budget.",
    "Zero-budget, unpermitted, architecture, dependency, security, ambiguous and invalid F7 cases escalate."
